{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>And the Egyptians wept for him.</b> Many words are defective in the letter bet; this one too is defective, and it is as though it were written ויבכו אותו במצרים." "<b>Seventy days.</b> Forty days of embalming and thirty of mourning, as we find regarding Moses and Aaron, that they wept for them thirty days. Another interpretation: seventy — his descendants who went down to Egypt, each weeping for him on his day."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 50, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:09:21.506076741Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}